[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Notes
[/meta]

h1. Notes

Tests for Section 14 of the specification.

h2. Titles

h3. Note without a title {#notes-untitled}
[code om]
[note]
General informational note.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
<p>General informational note.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Note with a title {#notes-titled}
[code om]
[note Mind the gap]
Doors open on the left.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1">Mind the gap</p>
<p>Doors open on the left.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. There are no note types {#notes-no-types}
[code om]
[note warning]
Text.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1">warning</p>
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Inline formatting in the title {#notes-title-formatting}
[code om]
[note *Important* steps]
Text.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1"><strong>Important</strong> steps</p>
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h2. IDs

h3. Titled notes are numbered in order {#notes-ids-sequence}
[code om]
[note First]
A.
[/note]

[note Second]
B.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1">First</p>
<p>A.</p>
</div>
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-2">
<p class="note-title" id="note-2">Second</p>
<p>B.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Untitled notes are not numbered {#notes-ids-untitled-skipped}
[code om]
[note]
A.
[/note]

[note Titled]
B.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
<p>A.</p>
</div>
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1">Titled</p>
<p>B.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Note ID after a heading with the same slug {#notes-ids-after-heading}
[code om]
h2. Note 1

[note Title]
Text.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<h2 id="note-1">Note 1</h2>
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1-2">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1-2">Title</p>
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Heading slug after a note with the same ID {#notes-ids-before-heading}
[code om]
[note Title]
Text.
[/note]

h2. Note 1
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1">Title</p>
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
<h2 id="note-1-2">Note 1</h2>
[/code]

h3. Note ID after an identical custom heading ID {#notes-ids-after-custom}
[code om]
h2. Intro {#note-1}

[note Title]
Text.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<h2 id="note-1">Intro</h2>
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1-2">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1-2">Title</p>
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h2. Content

h3. Paragraphs and line breaks {#notes-paragraphs}
[code om]
[note]
Line one.
Line two.

Second paragraph.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
<p>Line one.<br>
Line two.</p>
<p>Second paragraph.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Lists are allowed {#notes-list}
[code om]
[note]
* One
* Two
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
<ul>
<li>One</li>
<li>Two</li>
</ul>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Empty note {#notes-empty}
[code om]
[note]
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note"></div>
[/code]

h3. Closing tag on the opening line {#notes-close-same-line}
[code om]
[note][/note]
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Closing tag after text {#notes-close-after-text}
[code om]
[note]
Text.[/note]
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 2
[/code]

h3. Comments are allowed inside a note {#notes-comment}
[code om]
[note]
[comment]
Hidden.
[/comment]
Text.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Empty titled note {#notes-empty-titled}
[code om]
[note Title]
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note" aria-labelledby="note-1">
<p class="note-title" id="note-1">Title</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Nested notes are an error {#notes-nested}
[code om]
[note]
[note]
Nested note.
[/note]
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Code blocks are not allowed {#notes-code}
```om
[note]
[code]
x
[/code]
[/note]
```
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Tables are not allowed {#notes-table}
[code om]
[note]
| a |
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h2. Profiles

h3. Not allowed in the basic profile {#notes-profile-basic}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
[note]
Text.
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]
